{
  "id": "codex",
  "name": "Codex",
  "version": "0.1.3",
  "format": "toml",
  "configFile": "~/.codex/config.toml",
  "auth": "environment",
  "transport": "streamable-http",
  "skill": true,
  "minimumDocumentedVersion": null,
  "realClientTested": false,
  "sources": [
    "https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/extend/mcp?surface=cli"
  ],
  "setup": "https://mcp.yqstai.cn/setup?host=codex",
  "instructions": [
    "在本机安全设置 INT_AI_API_KEY 环境变量，不要发到聊天。",
    "将配置段合并到 ~/.codex/config.toml，保留其他服务器配置。",
    "完全重启 Codex，使其继承环境变量；在 MCP 设置确认工具已发现。"
  ],
  "config": "[mcp_servers.int-ai]\nurl = \"https://mcp.yqstai.cn/mcp\"\nbearer_token_env_var = \"INT_AI_API_KEY\"\n",
  "skillVersion": "0.1.4"
}
